The '''Gift Bag of the Century''' is an {{Epic}} item.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Gift Bag of the Century''' can be claimed after reaching Milestone VI during [[Raffle of the Century]] event.

== Usage ==
'''Gift Bag of the Century''' can be right-clicked to open a menu where player can choose any {{Yellow|'''MINOR'''}} reward to obtain.

